--- Part B: Core Spearman correlations ---
  delta_activity vs K119ub_log2fc              : rho = -0.0393 [-0.0503, -0.0284], p = 1.99e-12, n = 31947
  mean_delta_unnorm vs K119ub_log2fc           : rho = -0.0901 [-0.1009, -0.0792], p = 1.58e-58, n = 31947
  mean_delta_ABC vs K119ub_log2fc              : rho = -0.0232 [-0.0341, -0.0122], p = 3.41e-05, n = 31947
  delta_activity vs K119ub_mut_mean            : rho = +0.0008 [-0.0102, +0.0118], p = 8.85e-01, n = 31947
  K119ub_ctrl_mean vs K119ub_mut_mean (QC)     : rho = +0.8374 [+0.8341, +0.8406], p = 0.00e+00, n = 31947

--- Part C: Category comparison ---
  Category counts:
    Lost        : 4861
    Unchanged   : 21177
    Gained      : 5909

  Kruskal-Wallis: chi-sq = 81.03, df = 2, p = 2.54e-18
  Wilcoxon Lost vs Unchanged: p = 1.42e-17, r_rb = -0.0784 (n = 4861 vs 21177)
  Wilcoxon Gained vs Unchanged: p = 5.47e-06, r_rb = -0.0386 (n = 5909 vs 21177)
  Wilcoxon Lost vs Gained: p = 4.42e-04, r_rb = -0.0393 (n = 4861 vs 5909)

  Median K119ub log2FC by category:
    Lost        : median = +0.0047, mean = +0.0111, n = 4861
    Unchanged   : median = -0.0370, mean = -0.0349, n = 21177
    Gained      : median = -0.0152, mean = -0.0135, n = 5909

